{"sha": "1c0a2c4e697a87728a7616dfe926edc6673570237c9235772b0ee1567804cb3a", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:randomvar:10}", "$\\P(M \\leq k) = \\bigl(\\frac k6\\bigr)^2$（两颗骰子都不超过", "$k$，且相互独立），故 $\\P(M \\geq k) = 1 -", "\\bigl(\\frac{k-1}6\\bigr)^2$，且", "\\[", "\\E(M) = \\sum_{k=1}^6\\P(M \\geq k)", "= 6 - \\frac{0 + 1 + 4 + 9 + 16 + 25}{36}", "= 6 - \\frac{55}{36} = \\frac{161}{36} \\approx 4.47 ,", "\\]", "明显高于单颗骰子的均值 $3.5$，", "这正是最大值应有的情形。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:randomvar:11}", "设 $I_i = \\mathbf 1_{\\sigma(i) = i}$，则 $\\P(\\sigma(i) = i) =", "\\frac{(n-1)!}{n!} = \\frac1n$，故 $\\E(F_n) = n\\cdot\\frac1n =", "1$。当 $i \\neq j$ 时，$\\P(\\sigma(i) = i, \\sigma(j) = j) =", "\\frac{(n-2)!}{n!} = \\frac1{n(n-1)}$，因此", "\\[", "\\operatorname{Cov}(I_i, I_j) = \\frac1{n(n-1)} - \\frac1{n^2}", "= \\frac{1}{n^2(n-1)} .", "\\]", "由方差的运算规则", "（\\cref{thm:b2:randomvar:variancerules}），", "\\[", "V(F_n) = n\\cdot\\frac1n\\Bigl(1 - \\frac1n\\Bigr)", "+ n(n-1)\\cdot\\frac1{n^2(n-1)}", "= 1 - \\frac1n + \\frac1n = 1 .", "\\]", "均值为 $1$，方差为 $1$，与 $n$ 无关 --- 与", "匹配问题的泊松极限一致", "（见\\cref{exo:b2:proba:5}）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:randomvar:12}", "设 $T_n = \\sum_{k=1}^nG_k$，其中 $G_k \\sim \\mathcal G(k/n)$ 为", "缺少 $k$ 个时见到新玩具所需的时间，各阶段", "相互独立。由此", "\\[", "V(T_n) = \\sum_{k=1}^n\\frac{1 - k/n}{(k/n)^2}", "\\leq \\sum_{k=1}^n\\frac{n^2}{k^2}", "\\leq \\frac{\\pi^2}6\\,n^2 ,", "\\]", "由\\cref{ex:b2:fourier:basel}可得。又 $\\E(T_n) = nH_n$，$H_n =", "\\sum_1^n\\frac1k$（见\\cref{exo:b2:randomvar:3}），由切比雪夫不等式得，", "对 $\\varepsilon > 0$，", "\\[", "\\P\\bigl(\\abs{T_n - nH_n} \\geq \\varepsilon\\,n\\ln n\\bigr)", "\\leq \\frac{\\pi^2n^2/6}{\\varepsilon^2n^2\\ln^2 n}", "= \\frac{\\pi^2}{6\\,\\varepsilon^2\\ln^2n}", "\\xrightarrow[n\\to\\infty]{} 0 .", "\\]", "由于 $H_n \\sim \\ln n$，除以 $n\\ln n$ 可知", "$T_n/(n\\ln n) \\to 1$ 依概率成立：$T_n$ 的波动", "量级为 $n$，与均值 $n\\ln n$ 相比可以忽略。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:randomvar:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $\\E(S_n) = \\frac n2$，由马尔可夫不等式", "（\\cref{thm:b2:randomvar:markov}）可得 $\\P(S_n \\geq an) \\leq", "\\frac{n/2}{an} = \\frac1{2a}$。马尔可夫不等式只利用均值：它", "无法区分集中在 $n/2$ 处的随机变量与", "分布在 $0$ 与 $n$ 之间的变量，故它对尾概率的估计", "就好像全部质量都可能落在那里。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 公平的二项分布关于 $n/2$ 对称", "（$S_n$ 与 $n - S_n$ 同分布），故取 $x = n(a -", "\\frac12) > 0$，则两事件 $\\{S_n - \\frac n2 \\geq x\\}$ 与", "$\\{S_n - \\frac n2 \\leq -x\\}$ 互不相交且概率相等：", "$\\P(S_n \\geq an) = \\frac12\\P(\\abs{S_n - \\frac n2} \\geq x)$。", "由切比雪夫不等式，$V(S_n) = \\frac n4$：", "\\[", "\\P(S_n \\geq an)", "\\leq \\frac12\\cdot\\frac{n/4}{n^2(a - 1/2)^2}", "= \\frac1{8n(a - 1/2)^2},", "\\]", "它等于 $\\frac2n$，此时 $a = \\frac34$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 由独立性及乘积定理，", "$\\E(\\eu^{tS_n}) = \\bigl(\\E \\eu^{tX_1}\\bigr)^n = \\bigl(\\frac{1", "+ \\eu^t}2\\bigr)^n$。对 $\\eu^{tS_n}$ 应用马尔可夫不等式：", "\\[", "\\P(S_n \\geq an) \\leq \\eu^{-tan}\\Bigl(\\frac{1 +", "\\eu^t}2\\Bigr)^{\\!n} = \\exp\\Bigl(n\\bigl(\\ln\\tfrac{1 +", "\\eu^t}2 - ta\\bigr)\\Bigr).", "\\]", "指数关于 $t$ 的导数为 $\\frac{\\eu^t}{1 + \\eu^t}", "- a$，在 $\\eu^t = \\frac a{1-a}$ 处为零，即 $t^* =", "\\ln\\frac a{1-a} > 0$；此时 $\\frac{1 + \\eu^{t^*}}2 =", "\\frac1{2(1-a)}$，指数等于", "\\[", "n\\Bigl(-\\ln 2 - \\ln(1-a) - a\\ln\\frac a{1-a}\\Bigr)", "= -n\\bigl(\\ln2 + a\\ln a + (1-a)\\ln(1-a)\\bigr) = -n\\,I(a),", "\\]", "其中 $I(\\frac12) = 0$，且 $I'(a) = \\ln\\frac a{1-a} > 0$", "在 $\\intoo{\\frac12}1$ 上，故 $I(a) > 0$。当 $a = \\frac34$ 时：", "$\\eu^{-I(3/4)} = \\frac12(\\tfrac34)^{-3/4}(\\tfrac14)^{-1/4} =", "2\\cdot3^{-3/4}$，即\\cref{exo:b2:randomvar:7}给出的界。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 这 $n + 1$ 个数 $\\binom nja^j(1-a)^{n-j}$ 之和", "为 $1$，最大者是 $j = k = an$ 处的那一个（$\\mathcal B(n, a)$", "的众数为 $\\floor{(n+1)a} = k$，此处成立）。", "$n + 1$ 个和为 $1$ 的数，其最大者至少为", "$\\frac1{n+1}$：", "\\[", "\\binom nk a^k(1-a)^{n-k} \\geq \\frac1{n+1}", "\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad", "\\binom nk \\geq \\frac{a^{-an}(1-a)^{-n(1-a)}}{n+1}", "= \\frac{\\eu^{nH(a)}}{n+1}.", "\\]", "由此 $\\P(S_n \\geq an) \\geq \\binom{n}{an}2^{-n} \\geq", "\\eu^{n(H(a) - \\ln2)}/(n+1) = \\eu^{-nI(a)}/(n+1)$：在", "相差多项式因子 $n + 1$ 的意义下，切尔诺夫指数即为真值。", ""]}